$$ GetUBJSONSizeType -> GetUBJSONSizeValue { 1. Initialize size and type variables. 2. Handle optimized UBJSON format with type and size markers. 3. Validate and process size values based on the current character. 4. Return success or failure based on pair creation. }$$

