$$ OrderedMap {
    1. Initialize ordered_map with default or provided allocator.
    2. Emplace key-value pair, preserving insertion order.
    3. Access value by key with operator[].
    4. Access value by key with at(), throwing if key not found.
    5. Erase key-value pair by key.
    6. Erase range of key-value pairs by iterators.
    7. Count occurrences of key.
    8. Find key-value pair by key.
    9. Insert key-value pair, preserving insertion order.
    10. Insert range of key-value pairs.
}$$

