$$ AccessArrayElement -> { 1. Check if JSON value is an array or null. 2. Convert null to empty array if necessary. 3. Resize array if index is out of range. 4. Return the element. }$$

$$ AccessObjectElement -> { 1. Check if JSON value is an object or null. 2. Convert null to empty object if necessary. 3. Emplace key-value pair if key not found. 4. Return the element. }$$

