$$ABSTRACT JsonPatchOperations {
    1. GeneratePatch(source, target, path)
    2. ApplyPatch(source, patch)
}$$

$$ GeneratePatch -> JsonPatchOperations {
    1. Check if source and target are the same, return empty patch if true.
    2. If types differ, generate replace operation.
    3. Handle array type:
        3.1 Traverse common elements, generate recursive patches.
        3.2 Handle remaining elements in source and target.
    4. Handle object type:
        4.1 Traverse source object, generate patches for missing keys in target.
        4.2 Traverse target object, generate patches for new keys.
    5. Handle primitive types: generate replace operation.
}$$

$$ ApplyPatch -> JsonPatchOperations {
    1. Create a copy of the source object.
    2. Apply each operation in the patch:
        2.1 Replace: set value at path.
        2.2 Add: add value at path.
        2.3 Remove: remove value at path.
    3. Return the modified object.
}$$

